# ── Sakhi AI environment variables ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to your environment / Keys UI. Never commit real values.

# Supabase (client — safe to expose in the browser)
# Get these from: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# NOTE: normal sign-in is EMAIL + PASSWORD via Supabase Auth. Email OTP (a
# 6-digit code) is used ONLY during account creation. No extra secrets are
# needed in the app, but the Supabase project must be configured once
# (Dashboard → Auth):
#   * Email provider enabled (Auth → Providers → Email).
#   * Magic Link email template edited to include {{ .Token }} so new-account
#     signups receive a numeric code instead of a clickable link (Auth →
#     Email Templates → Magic Link).
#   * "Allow new users to sign up" enabled (Auth → Sign In / Up).
#
# Password recovery uses Supabase's Reset Password email (a link that opens
# the app's /reset-password screen).
#
# The mobile number is still collected during onboarding and stored on the
# user's profile (for a future SMS OTP migration and SOS alerts), but it is
# never used to send the login code.
